: "d3101ef09d15a5fdb2a8f9a7b5e29963cec7b8470099c32d99d37b3f26da4d36", "start": 56.79, "text": "for my friend and for audience? \u003e\u003e Absolutely. I'll translate as you go preview model. \u003e\u003e Today we're taking a look at our preview model which makes conversation between humans and AI easier. It has many features like web search and artifac", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "hint": {"kind": "opening_prose", "text": "For AI to collaborate with people the way we do with each other, it should listen, talk, watch, show, and think at the same time — just like people do. Introducing interaction models, an AI designed from the ground up for real-time collaboration. __ This is a preview demo of our interaction model. You can read the full technical report at https://thinkingmachines.ai/blog/interaction-models/ No tags [00:00:01] Hey, I need your help with something [00:00:01] Hey, I need your help with something today. You ready? [00:00:03] today. You ready? [00:00:03] today. You ready? \u003e\u003e Absolutely, I'm ready. ", "truncated": true}, "platform": "youtube", "profile": "librarian", "schema_version": 1, "selection_version": "spread-longest-v2", "slug": "Introducing_interaction_models_Thinking_Machines_Lab", "source_revision": "ab9560cff53de0ee3fb0666fbffb020ab236bf2092286ba513994ea71202f24e", "source_type": "video", "status": "evidenced", "summary_hint": "For AI to collaborate with people the way we do with each other, it should listen, talk, watch, show, and think at the same time — just like people do. Introducing interaction models, an AI designed from the ground up for real-time collaboration. __ This is a preview demo of our interaction model. You can read the full technical report at https://thinkingmachines.ai/blog/interaction-models/ No tags [00:00:01] Hey, I need your help with something [00:00:01] Hey, I need your help with something today. You ready? [00:00:03] today. You ready? [00:00:03] today. You ready? \u003e\u003e Absolutely, I'm ready. ", "title": "Introducing interaction models | Thinking Machines Lab", "topic": "Uncategorized", "truncated": true, "truncation": {"byte_budget": false, "fields": [], "selection": false}, "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A12AVongNN4", "video_id": "A12AVongNN4", "yoinked_at": "2026-05-12T18:38:39"}
