is JSX here which is an artifact. When you open this, it will render this interactive uh interactive bar charts with with yearly distributions and organization complete. And you can see the lines and th", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "AI and ML", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=MgwjGpLHaWE\u0026t=2s", "end": 108.87, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "69610d94de599884099992fe93bff5128be934008aefca72e276c78f9d9173b7", "start": 2.67, "text": "Hey, so Anthropic just launched this thing. It's called Claude Co-work and it's a new feature for Mac users. They call it a research preview that they built in a week and a half apparently using live coding. Yes, even big companies do this.", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=MgwjGpLHaWE\u0026t=108s", "end": 281.708, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "1fc5661e06b023e5ff8bcc85ad947c1dbc67f95d1c4413f0df687705291fe7c1", "start": 108.88, "text": "Haha. Uh but it's it's probably going to make it anyway. Uh all of these commands are possible with Claude code. However, for non-developers, they are not as comfortable being inside the CLI. And so, it matters because for many many people ", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=MgwjGpLHaWE\u0026t=108s", "end": 281.708, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "9011011ceee7d88db1520c95d1beadcc858e0bade99dd8e6184e593ca5604a75", "start": 108.88, "text": " looks. I have folders 2023, 2024 and they are sorted into month by month screenshots. That's pretty cool. And at the end of this you can say, \"Okay, create an artifact describing the work you did and the stats of how many screenshots I tak", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=MgwjGpLHaWE\u0026t=108s", "end": 281.708, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "f32dfa4b97ca88962ac2fef6cbda3c7d9cf7753ee00dc014c56188ff6e0a18c1", "start": 108.88, "text": " 2026. Very interesting that I have this JSX here which is an artifact. When you open this, it will render this interactive uh interactive bar charts with with yearly distributions and organization complete. And you can see the lines and th", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}], "hint": {"kind": "opening_prose", "text": "\u003c!-- HOOK_START --\u003e \u003c!-- HOOK_END --\u003e Anthropic just launched Claude Cowork — a new research preview feature for Max subscribers that brings the power of Claude Code to non-developers. In this video, I test it out by having it organize years of screenshots into folders by month, then generate interactive statistics about my screenshot habits. What you'll see: How Claude Cowork creates a sandbox to run code on your local files Real-time task execution with progress tracking The ability to interrupt and ask questions mid-task Artifact generation for beautiful interactive data visualizations This", "truncated": true}, "platform": "youtube", "profile": "librarian", "schema_version": 1, "selection_version": "spread-longest-v2", "slug": "Claude_Cowork_Anthropic_s_New_AI_Agent_That_Runs_Code_on_Your_Files_Max_Feature", "source_revision": "18ffb4d17db70e7f300cbc5e4f8234a184569ec9b10a981af978316caddee4a1", "source_type": "video", "status": "evidenced", "summary_hint": "\u003c!-- HOOK_START --\u003e \u003c!-- HOOK_END --\u003e Anthropic just launched Claude Cowork — a new research preview feature for Max subscribers that brings the power of Claude Code to non-developers. In this video, I test it out by having it organize years of screenshots into folders by month, then generate interactive statistics about my screenshot habits. What you'll see: How Claude Cowork creates a sandbox to run code on your local files Real-time task execution with progress tracking The ability to interrupt and ask questions mid-task Artifact generation for beautiful interactive data visualizations This", "title": "Claude Cowork: Anthropic's New AI Agent That Runs Code on Your Files (Max Feature)", "topic": "AI and ML", "truncated": true, "truncation": {"byte_budget": false, "fields": [], "selection": false}, "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MgwjGpLHaWE", "video_id": "MgwjGpLHaWE", "yoinked_at": "2026-05-19T17:48:12"}
